  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Religious Leaders Promoting Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative aims to addressing exclusion of LGBTI persons by challenging the negative attitudes of religious leaders and/in respective congregations. It will contribute to churches/congregations and community leaders becoming inclusive, cohesive and open to people discriminated against for being LGBT+. The initiative will tackle the lack of information and discrimination still prevailing in the field of education, in the community and in churches, resulting in the transmission of incorrect, prejudiced and stereotyped information, as well as a negative environment for everyday life.</narrative>
  </description>
